                  <zone h='12333' id='637' type-v2='text' w='45668' x='48234' y='83222'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e00012' fontsize='8'>Automatic BEs</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'> represent </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>BE -2 months</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'> before the RR date. </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontsize='8'>On the 25th of each month,  BEs change to BE -1 month before the RR date.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>RR Date : 24-Nov-22 ----&gt; BE09-22            RR Date : 25-Nov-22 ----&gt; BE10-22</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>*If you don&apos;t see any data, you can select the lates BE from BE Selection. There might be delays in the pipeline.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
